  "verseCount": 24,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "3",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "GEN 3"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "3",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "The Fall",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 3:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Now the serpent was more crafty than any of the wild animals the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "GEN.3.1",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "GEN.3.1"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "God had made. He said to the woman, \"Did God really say, 'You must not eat from any tree in the garden'?\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.3.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The woman said to the serpent, \"We may eat fruit from the trees in the garden,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "but God did say, 'You must not eat fruit from the tree that is in the middle of the garden, and you must not touch it, or you will die.' \"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.3.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"You will not certainly die,\" the serpent said to the woman.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.3.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"For God knows that when you eat from it your eyes will be opened, and you will be like God, knowing good and evil.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.3.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 3:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "When the woman saw that the fruit of the tree was good for food and pleasing to the eye, and also desirable for gaining wisdom, she took some and ate it. She also gave some to her husband, who was with her, and he ate it.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.3.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 3:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then the eyes of both of them were opened, and they realized they were naked; so they sewed fig leaves together and made coverings for themselves.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.3.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 3:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then the man and his wife heard the sound of the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.3.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "GEN.3.8",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "GEN.3.8"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "God as he was walking in the garden in the cool of the day, and they hid from the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.3.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "GEN.3.8",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "GEN.3.8"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "God among the trees of the garden.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.3.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.3.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "GEN.3.9",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "GEN.3.9"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "God called to the man, \"Where are you?\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.3.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 3:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He answered, \"I heard you in the garden, and I was afraid because I was naked; so I hid.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.3.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 3:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And he said, \"Who told you that you were naked? Have you eaten from the tree that I commanded you not to eat from?\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.3.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 3:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The man said, \"The woman you put here with me—she gave me some fruit from the tree, and I ate it.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.3.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.3.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 3:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.3.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.3.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "GEN.3.13",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "GEN.3.13"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "God said to the woman, \"What is this you have done?\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.3.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.3.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p",
        "vid": "GEN 3:13"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "The woman said, \"The serpent deceived me, and I ate.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.3.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.3.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 3:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.3.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.3.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "GEN.3.14",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "GEN.3.14"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "God said to the serpent, \"Because you have done this,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.3.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.3.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "GEN 3:14"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "\"Cursed are you above all livestock",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.3.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.3.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "GEN 3:14"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "and all wild animals!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.3.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.3.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "GEN 3:14"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "You will crawl on your belly",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.3.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.3.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "GEN 3:14"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "and you will eat dust",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.3.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.3.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "GEN 3:14"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "all the days of your life.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.3.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.3.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 3:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And I will put enmity",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.3.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.3.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "GEN 3:15"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "between you and the woman,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.3.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.3.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "GEN 3:15"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "and between your offspring",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.3.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.3.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "and hers;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.3.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.3.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "GEN 3:15"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "he will crush",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.3.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.3.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "your head,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.3.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.3.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "GEN 3:15"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "and you will strike his heel.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.3.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.3.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 3:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To the woman he said,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.3.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.3.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "GEN 3:16"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "\"I will make your pains in childbearing very severe;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.3.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.3.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "GEN 3:16"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "with painful labor you will give birth to children.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.3.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.3.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "GEN 3:16"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Your desire will be for your husband,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.3.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.3.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "GEN 3:16"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "and he will rule over you.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.3.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.3.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 3:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To Adam he said, \"Because you listened to your wife and ate fruit from the tree about which I commanded you, 'You must not eat from it,'",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.3.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.3.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "GEN 3:17"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "\"Cursed is the ground because of you;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.3.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.3.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "GEN 3:17"
      },
      "items": [
        {
